{"pageProps":{"data":{"contentHtml":"<h4 id=\"bloonstd6-mod-helper\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#bloonstd6-mod-helper\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a href=\"README\" title=\"README\">BloonsTD6 Mod Helper</a></h4>\n<h3 id=\"btd_mod_helperapi\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#btd_mod_helperapi\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a href=\"README#BTD_Mod_Helper.Api\" title=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api\">BTD_Mod_Helper.Api</a></h3>\n<h2 id=\"modsavedata-class\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#modsavedata-class\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>ModSaveData Class</h2>\n<p>Mod Content class to easily save and load data that should persist between sessions. All saved data are strings.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-csharp\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">abstract</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">ModSaveData</span> : <span class=\"hljs-title\">ModContent</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Inheritance <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/System.Object\" title=\"System.Object\">System.Object</a>  <a href=\"https://github.com/gurrenm3/BTD-Mod-Helper/blob/master/Documentation/BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModContent.md\" title=\"ModConent\">ModContent</a>  ModSaveData</p>\n<h3 id=\"methods\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#methods\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Methods</h3>\n<p><a name=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModSaveData.Save()\"></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"modsavedatasave-method\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#modsavedatasave-method\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>ModSaveData.Save() Method</h2>\n<p>Saves this ModSaveData using the returned encoded string.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-csharp\"><span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">abstract</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Save</span>()</span>;\n</code></pre>\n<p><a name=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModSaveData.Load(string)\"></a></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#returns\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Returns</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/System.String\" title=\"System.String\">System.String</a> The encoded save data.</p>\n<h2 id=\"modsavedataloadstring-method\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#modsavedataloadstring-method\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>ModSaveData.Load(string) Method</h2>\n<p>Loads this ModSaveData from the provided encoded string.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-csharp\"><span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">abstract</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Load</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> data</span>)</span>;\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"parameters\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#parameters\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Parameters</h4>\n<p><a name=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModSaveData.Load(string).data\"></a></p>\n<p><code class=\"hljs\">data</code> <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/System.String\" title=\"System.String\">System.String</a>\nThe encoded save data.</p>","tableOfContentsHtml":"<nav class=\"toc\"><ol class=\"toc-level toc-level-1\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h4\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h4\" href=\"#bloonstd6-mod-helper\">BloonsTD6 Mod Helper</a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h3\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h3\" href=\"#btd_mod_helperapi\">BTD_Mod_Helper.Api</a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h2\"><